45">yo</span><span begin="2:37.645" end="2:37.975">boku</span><span begin="2:37.975" end="2:38.230">ra</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>DECO*27</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:38.230"><div begin="0.691" end="2:38.230"><p begin="0.691" end="9.381" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.691" end="1.006">きっ</span><span begin="1.006" end="1.393">と</span><span begin="2.521" end="2.982">届</span><span begin="2.982" end="3.270">く</span><span begin="3.270" end="3.694">は</span><span begin="3.694" end="4.132">ず</span> <span begin="6.025" end="6.327">きっ</span><span begin="6.327" end="6.759">と</span><span begin="7.845" end="7.993">見</span><span begin="7.993" end="8.272">え</span><span begin="8.272" end="8.587">る</span><span begin="8.587" end="8.969">は</span><span begin="8.969" end="9.381">ず</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我坚信 你一定能看到</span></p><p begin="9.976" end="15.432" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.976" end="10.279">そん</span><span begin="10.279" end="10.741">な</span><span begin="11.056" end="11.497">会っ</span><span begin="11.497" end="11.563">て</span><span begin="11.563" end="11.716">み</span><span begin="11.716" end="11.848">た</span><span begin="11.848" end="12.009">い</span><span begin="12.009" end="12.191">未</span><span begin="12.191" end="12.482">来</span><span begin="12.482" end="12.752">を</span> <span begin="12.752" end="13.136">僕</span><span begin="13.136" end="13.496">は</span><span begin="13.652" end="13.823">ひ</span><span begin="13.823" end="13.971">と</span><span begin="13.971" end="14.144">り</span><span begin="14.144" end="14.333">き</span><span begin="14.333" end="14.507">り</span><span begin="14.507" end="14.619">の</span><span begin="14.619" end="14.780">セ</span><span begin="14.780" end="14.948">カ</span><span begin="14.948" end="15.191">イ</span><span begin="15.191" end="15.432">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想在这个世界上独自看到这样的未来</span></p><p begin="15.668" end="20.161" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.668" end="15.927">ずっ</span><span begin="15.927" end="16.327">と</span><span begin="16.690" end="16.909">そ</span><span begin="16.909" end="17.194">う</span><span begin="17.194" end="17.485">歌</span><span begin="17.485" end="17.666">う</span><span begin="17.666" end="18.007">たっ</span><span begin="18.007" end="18.169">て</span><span begin="18.169" end="18.340">い</span><span begin="18.340" end="20.161">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我自始至终歌唱着</span></p><p begin="28.267" end="33.513" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.267" end="28.670">今</span><span begin="29.267" end="29.427">聞</span><span begin="29.427" end="29.633">こ</span><span begin="29.633" end="29.792">え</span><span begin="29.792" end="29.993">た</span><span begin="29.993" end="30.281">よ</span> <span begin="31.493" end="31.650">ほ</span><span begin="31.650" end="32.012">ら</span><span begin="32.510" end="32.817">少</span><span begin="32.817" end="33.039">し</span><span begin="33.039" end="33.222">だ</span><span begin="33.222" end="33.513">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我现在可以隐隐约约听到 你的存在</span></p><p begin="34.340" end="39.237" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.340" end="34.698">君</span><span begin="34.698" end="34.859">を</span><span begin="34.859" end="35.283">感</span><span begin="35.283" end="35.459">じ</span><span begin="35.459" end="35.648">た</span><span begin="35.648" end="35.993">よ</span> <span begin="37.199" end="37.301">メ</span><span begin="37.301" end="37.509">ロ</span><span begin="37.509" end="37.946">ディー</span><span begin="37.946" end="38.111">が</span><span begin="38.111" end="38.553">リン</span><span begin="38.553" end="38.733">ク</span><span begin="38.733" end="38.901">す</span><span begin="38.901" end="39.237">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我感受到了我们的旋律在共鸣</span></p><p begin="41.248" end="46.521" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.248" end="41.620">今</span><span begin="42.208" end="42.591">繋</span><span begin="42.591" end="42.762">が</span><span begin="42.762" end="42.975">る</span><span begin="42.975" end="43.278">よ</span> <span begin="44.504" end="44.948">今</span><span begin="45.512" end="45.804">重</span><span begin="45.804" end="45.999">な</span><span begin="45.999" end="46.212">る</span><span begin="46.212" end="46.521">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻相互连结 终于重叠</span></p><p begin="47.091" end="56.988" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.091" end="47.475">伝</span><span begin="47.475" end="47.631">え</span><span begin="47.631" end="47.823">た</span><span begin="47.823" end="48.310">かっ</span><span begin="48.310" end="48.449">た</span><span begin="48.449" end="48.610">こ</span><span begin="48.610" end="48.962">と</span> <span begin="50.134" end="50.470">山</span><span begin="50.470" end="50.680">ほ</span><span begin="50.680" end="50.884">ど</span><span begin="50.884" end="51.067">あ</span><span begin="51.067" end="51.530">るん</span><span begin="51.530" end="51.724">だ</span><span begin="51.724" end="51.902">け</span><span begin="51.902" end="52.274">ど</span><span begin="52.801" end="52.949">ど</span><span begin="52.949" end="53.119">う</span><span begin="53.119" end="53.321">し</span><span begin="53.321" end="53.470">よ</span><span begin="53.470" end="53.946">う</span> <span begin="55.473" end="56.988">あぁ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想说的话堆积如山却不知如何讲起</span></p><p begin="56.581" end="1:02.650" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.031" end="58.196">見</span><span begin="58.196" end="58.355">た</span><span begin="58.355" end="58.745">こ</span><span begin="58.745" end="58.967">と</span><span begin="58.967" end="59.159">も</span><span begin="59.159" end="59.309">な</span><span begin="59.309" end="59.594">い</span><span begin="59.594" end="1:00.001">顔</span><span begin="1:00.001" end="1:00.139">で</span> <span begin="1:00.139" end="1:00.478">君</span><span begin="1:00.478" end="1:00.667">は</span><span begin="1:00.667" end="1:01.033">君</span><span begin="1:01.033" end="1:01.210">を</span><span begin="1:01.210" end="1:01.387">ダ</span><span begin="1:01.387" end="1:01.591">メ</span><span begin="1:01.591" end="1:01.798">と</span><span begin="1:01.798" end="1:02.043">言</span><span begin="1:02.043" end="1:02.175">う</span><span begin="1:02.175" end="1:02.383">け</span><span begin="1:02.383" end="1:02.650">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你总用着素未谋面的表情 否定现在的自我</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="56.581" end="57.818"><span begin="56.581" end="57.002">(Say,</span> <span begin="57.002" end="57.572">woh-</span><span begin="57.572" end="57.818">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:03.223" end="1:09.039" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.223" end="1:03.439">未</span><span begin="1:03.439" end="1:03.781">来</span><span begin="1:03.781" end="1:03.943">に</span><span begin="1:03.943" end="1:04.144">い</span><span begin="1:04.144" end="1:04.348">る</span><span begin="1:04.348" end="1:04.534">理</span><span begin="1:04.534" end="1:04.942">想</span><span begin="1:04.942" end="1:05.176">の</span><span begin="1:05.176" end="1:05.566">君</span><span begin="1:05.566" end="1:05.810">を</span> <span begin="1:06.050" end="1:06.368">今</span><span begin="1:06.368" end="1:06.572">の</span><span begin="1:06.572" end="1:06.974">君</span><span begin="1:06.974" end="1:07.178">に</span><span begin="1:07.178" end="1:07.346">押</span><span begin="1:07.346" end="1:07.550">し</span><span begin="1:07.550" end="1:07.760">付</span><span begin="1:07.760" end="1:07.961">け</span><span begin="1:07.961" end="1:08.162">過</span><span begin="1:08.162" end="1:08.357">ぎ</span><span begin="1:08.357" end="1:08.643">な</span><span begin="1:08.643" end="1:08.808">い</span><span begin="1:08.808" end="1:09.039">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">请不要将未来的理想 一股脑地强加给自己</span></p><p begin="1:09.432" end="1:15.346" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.830" end="1:10.993">見</span><span begin="1:10.993" end="1:11.167">た</span><span begin="1:11.167" end="1:11.569">こ</span><span begin="1:11.569" end="1:11.767">と</span><span begin="1:11.767" end="1:11.935">も</span><span begin="1:11.935" end="1:12.139">な</span><span begin="1:12.139" end="1:12.313">い</span><span begin="1:12.313" end="1:12.610">景</span><span begin="1:12.610" end="1:12.907">色</span> <span begin="1:12.907" end="1:13.096">見</span><span begin="1:13.096" end="1:13.303">せ</span><span begin="1:13.303" end="1:13.507">合</span><span begin="1:13.507" end="1:13.690">う</span><span begin="1:13.690" end="1:13.882">い</span><span begin="1:13.882" end="1:14.110">つ</span><span begin="1:14.110" end="1:14.290">か</span><span begin="1:14.290" end="1:14.488">が</span><span begin="1:14.488" end="1:14.680">来</span><span begin="1:14.680" end="1:14.902">る</span><span begin="1:14.902" end="1:15.099">ま</span><span begin="1:15.099" end="1:15.346">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些心碎的瞬间 直到能一起看到新风景的那天来临</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:09.432" end="1:10.621"><span begin="1:09.432" end="1:09.820">(Say,</span> <span begin="1:09.820" end="1:10.402">woh-</span><span begin="1:10.402" end="1:10.621">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:15.965" end="1:21.577" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.965" end="1:16.131">つ</span><span begin="1:16.131" end="1:16.341">ら</span><span begin="1:16.341" end="1:16.485">い</span><span begin="1:16.485" end="1:16.677">こ</span><span begin="1:16.677" end="1:16.878">と</span> <span begin="1:16.878" end="1:17.061">泣</span><span begin="1:17.061" end="1:17.250">き</span><span begin="1:17.250" end="1:17.442">た</span><span begin="1:17.442" end="1:17.649">く</span><span begin="1:17.649" end="1:17.856">な</span><span begin="1:17.856" end="1:18.069">る</span><span begin="1:18.069" end="1:18.252">こ</span><span begin="1:18.252" end="1:18.591">と</span> <span begin="1:19.121" end="1:19.269">た</span><span begin="1:19.269" end="1:19.458">ま</span><span begin="1:19.458" end="1:19.662">に</span><span begin="1:19.662" end="1:19.887">は</span><span begin="1:19.887" end="1:20.279">預</span><span begin="1:20.279" end="1:20.480">け</span><span begin="1:20.480" end="1:20.636">会</span><span begin="1:20.636" end="1:20.809">お</span><span begin="1:20.809" end="1:21.577">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些让人想哭的瞬间 就让我们互相分担吧</span></p><p begin="1:22.095" end="1:28.317" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.095" end="1:22.210">ハ</span><span begin="1:22.210" end="1:23.446">ロー、</span><span begin="1:23.643" end="1:23.773">セ</span><span begin="1:23.773" end="1:23.951">カ</span><span begin="1:23.951" end="1:24.805">イ</span> <span begin="1:25.054" end="1:25.375">僕</span><span begin="1:25.375" end="1:25.549">の</span><span begin="1:25.549" end="1:26.005">声</span><span begin="1:26.005" end="1:26.149">は</span><span begin="1:26.149" end="1:26.581">ちゃん</span><span begin="1:26.581" end="1:26.795">と</span><span begin="1:26.795" end="1:27.284">届</span><span begin="1:27.284" end="1:27.395">い</span><span begin="1:27.395" end="1:27.554">て</span><span begin="1:27.554" end="1:27.755">る</span><span begin="1:27.755" end="1:27.976">か</span><span begin="1:27.976" end="1:28.317">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你好世界 我的声音是否可以真切传达</span></p><p begin="1:28.616" end="1:34.391" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.616" end="1:29.201">思っ</span><span begin="1:29.201" end="1:29.339">た</span><span begin="1:29.339" end="1:29.531">よ</span><span begin="1:29.531" end="1:29.720">り</span><span begin="1:29.720" end="1:30.062">も</span><span begin="1:30.188" end="1:30.511">大</span><span begin="1:30.511" end="1:30.958">丈</span><span begin="1:30.958" end="1:31.301">夫</span> <span begin="1:31.301" end="1:31.691">君</span><span begin="1:31.691" end="1:31.856">は</span><span begin="1:31.856" end="1:32.063">ひ</span><span begin="1:32.063" end="1:32.261">と</span><span begin="1:32.261" e