="2:07.365" end="2:07.437">も</span><span begin="2:07.437" end="2:07.624">な</span><span begin="2:07.624" end="2:07.773">い</span><span begin="2:07.773" end="2:07.929">も</span> <span begin="2:07.929" end="2:08.430">そん</span><span begin="2:08.430" end="2:08.544">な</span><span begin="2:08.544" end="2:08.653">の</span><span begin="2:08.653" end="2:08.737">ど</span><span begin="2:08.737" end="2:08.857">う</span><span begin="2:08.857" end="2:08.933">で</span><span begin="2:08.933" end="2:09.039">も</span><span begin="2:09.039" end="2:09.210">い</span><span begin="2:09.210" end="2:09.304">い</span><span begin="2:09.304" end="2:09.434">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">左思右想的烦恼 那都是无关紧要的</span></p><p begin="2:09.644" end="2:12.130" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.644" end="2:09.804">や</span><span begin="2:09.804" end="2:09.972">り</span><span begin="2:09.972" end="2:10.161">た</span><span begin="2:10.161" end="2:10.353">い</span><span begin="2:10.353" end="2:10.527">よ</span><span begin="2:10.527" end="2:10.770">う</span><span begin="2:10.770" end="2:10.974">に</span><span begin="2:10.974" end="2:11.169">や</span><span begin="2:11.169" end="2:11.307">ろ</span><span begin="2:11.307" end="2:12.130">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们尽情舞动</span></p><p begin="2:12.806" end="2:15.592" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.806" end="2:12.902">飛</span><span begin="2:12.902" end="2:12.983">び</span><span begin="2:12.983" end="2:13.268">込ん</span><span begin="2:13.268" end="2:13.473">で</span><span begin="2:13.473" end="2:13.579">い</span><span begin="2:13.579" end="2:13.692">こ</span><span begin="2:13.692" end="2:13.983">う</span> <span begin="2:13.983" end="2:14.352">僕</span><span begin="2:14.352" end="2:14.508">ら</span><span begin="2:14.508" end="2:14.695">の</span><span begin="2:14.695" end="2:14.844">セ</span><span begin="2:14.844" end="2:14.955">カ</span><span begin="2:14.955" end="2:15.140">イ</span><span begin="2:15.140" end="2:15.592">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">勇敢飞入 属于我们自己的世界</span></p><p begin="2:15.946" end="2:18.641" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.946" end="2:16.136">正</span><span begin="2:16.136" end="2:16.403">解</span><span begin="2:16.403" end="2:16.601">か</span><span begin="2:16.601" end="2:16.712">不</span><span begin="2:16.712" end="2:16.919">正</span><span begin="2:16.919" end="2:17.186">解</span><span begin="2:17.186" end="2:17.457">か</span><span begin="2:17.457" end="2:17.596">わ</span><span begin="2:17.596" end="2:17.722">か</span><span begin="2:17.722" end="2:17.913">ら</span><span begin="2:17.913" end="2:18.026">な</span><span begin="2:18.026" end="2:18.200">く</span><span begin="2:18.200" end="2:18.305">て</span><span begin="2:18.305" end="2:18.641">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管你不知是非对错</span></p><p begin="2:18.723" end="2:21.852" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.723" end="2:19.063">僕</span><span begin="2:19.063" end="2:19.270">に</span><span begin="2:19.270" end="2:19.594">あ</span><span begin="2:19.594" end="2:19.690">る</span><span begin="2:19.690" end="2:19.936">想</span><span begin="2:19.936" end="2:20.086">い</span><span begin="2:20.086" end="2:20.251">も</span> <span begin="2:20.251" end="2:20.626">君</span><span begin="2:20.626" end="2:20.845">に</span><span begin="2:20.845" end="2:21.091">あ</span><span begin="2:21.091" end="2:21.180">る</span><span begin="2:21.180" end="2:21.523">願</span><span begin="2:21.523" end="2:21.667">い</span><span begin="2:21.667" end="2:21.852">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你怀抱的思念和珍藏已久的心愿</span></p><p begin="2:21.859" end="2:25.647" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.859" end="2:22.042">きっ</span><span begin="2:22.042" end="2:22.225">と</span><span begin="2:22.225" end="2:22.426">消</span><span begin="2:22.426" end="2:22.640">え</span><span begin="2:22.640" end="2:22.868">な</span><span begin="2:22.868" end="2:23.132">いん</span><span begin="2:23.132" end="2:23.228">だ</span><span begin="2:23.228" end="2:23.399">よ</span> <span begin="2:23.399" end="2:23.613">ずっ</span><span begin="2:23.613" end="2:23.810">と</span><span begin="2:23.810" end="2:23.999">セ</span><span begin="2:23.999" end="2:24.218">カ</span><span begin="2:24.218" end="2:24.334">イ</span><span begin="2:24.334" end="2:24.508">は</span><span begin="2:24.508" end="2:24.682">終</span><span begin="2:24.682" end="2:24.824">わ</span><span begin="2:24.824" end="2:24.993">ら</span><span begin="2:24.993" end="2:25.111">な</span><span begin="2:25.111" end="2:25.235">い</span><span begin="2:25.235" end="2:25.647">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">都绝不会因此消散</span></p><p begin="2:26.036" end="2:31.267" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.036" end="2:26.409">今</span><span begin="2:26.999" end="2:27.189">繋</span><span begin="2:27.189" end="2:27.534">が</span><span begin="2:27.534" end="2:27.742">る</span><span begin="2:27.742" end="2:28.023">よ</span> <span begin="2:29.178" end="2:29.542">今</span><span begin="2:30.180" end="2:30.505">重</span><span begin="2:30.505" end="2:30.691">な</span><span begin="2:30.691" end="2:30.901">る</span><span begin="2:30.901" end="2:31.267">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻相互连结 终于重叠</span></p><p begin="2:32.349" end="2:38.230" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.349" end="2:32.503">ほ</span><span begin="2:32.503" end="2:32.761">ら</span><span begin="2:33.336" end="2:33.469">聞</span><span begin="2:33.469" end="2:33.664">こ</span><span begin="2:33.664" end="2:33.850">え</span><span begin="2:33.850" end="2:34.042">る</span><span begin="2:34.042" end="2:34.342">よ</span> <span begin="2:35.505" end="2:35.659">ほ</span><span begin="2:35.659" end="2:35.947">ら</span><span begin="2:36.471" end="2:36.844">伝</span><span begin="2:36.844" end="2:37.041">わ</span><span begin="2:37.041" end="2:37.216">る</span><span begin="2:37.216" end="2:37.645">よ</span><span begin="2:37.645" end="2:37.975">僕</span><span begin="2:37.975" end="2:38.230">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看 这世间如你所愿</span></p></div></body></tt>